Subject: [PATCH] fix: corrige advertencias de flutter analyze (withOpacity y
 variable sin usar)

- Reemplaza Colors.withOpacity() (deprecated) por withValues(alpha:)
  en users_roles_screen.dart
- Elimina el getter _code sin usar en email_verification_screen.dart

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MGTVqKTyALf5JDawT7asgd
---
 lib/screens/admin/users_roles_screen.dart       | 4 +++-
 lib/screens/auth/email_verification_screen.dart | 2 --
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/lib/screens/admin/users_roles_screen.dart b/lib/screens/admin/users_roles_screen.dart
index e4e09f2..0cd24d6 100644
--- a/lib/screens/admin/users_roles_screen.dart
